section.center(data-transition="fade", data-state="hide-menubar")
	h1 Simplemenu
	h3 for Reveal.js
	p.smaller Manual menu, linking to #[code data-name]


section(data-name="Why?")
	section.center
		h4 Why?
		p Sometimes manually linking the menu is needed. Simplemenu can do that too.
		p.small Manually linking can be done through #[code id] and #[code data-name]. #[br]These slides explain the use of #[code data-name].

section(data-name="Set it up")

	section.center
		h4 It's easy to set up, but expects a few things:
		ul.small
			li Menu items can only be top-level sections: regular horizontal slides or vertical stacks.
			li Create an element that will hold the links. 
			li Inside this menu, there have to be anchors. The href will be ignored, so it can stay empty: #[code &lt;a href="#"&gt;].
			li The textcontent of each link has to be the same as the #[code data-name] of each linked section. This text-content is used to create a data-attribute for each link which is then used for matching. This way, any changes to the text of the link (for example, when it is translated) have no effect on the linking.

	section
		h4 JavaScript
		p.small Load the Simplemenu script and make a reference to it in the Reveal plugin options. Add the selectby option and set it to  #[code data-name].
		br
		pre
				code.hljs.html(data-line-numbers).
					&lt;script src="plugin/simplemenu/simplemenu.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
					&lt;script&gt;
					    Reveal.initialize({
					        simplemenu: {
					            selectby: "data-name"
					        }
					        plugins: [ Simplemenu ]
					    });
					&lt;script&gt;
	section
		h4 HTML Markup
		p.small Make sure that the text content of your links is the same as the #[code data-name] attribute of your sections. In the example below it is literally "Put some text here".
		pre
			code.
				&lt;nav class="menubar"&gt;
				    &lt;ul class="menu"&gt;
				        &lt;li&gt;
				            &lt;a href="#"&gt;Put some text here&lt;/a&gt;
				        &lt;/li&gt;
				    &lt;/ul&gt;
				&lt;/nav&gt;
				&lt;div class="slides"&gt;
				    &lt;section data-name="Put some text here"&gt;
				        //...
				    &lt;/section&gt;
				        //...
				&lt;/div&gt;
	section
		h4 That’s it!